    {
      "id": "p0190-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Dr. Al phys regularly posts on the Undernet, the Underground's version of the Internet. As such, she often includes smilies, emoticons, and Internet slang in her social media messages.",
